meta {
  name: Teach a fact
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/learn
  body: json
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "fact": "Deployments run through Octopus on Fridays.",
    "share": false
  }
}

docs {
  Teach the system a fact / ingest a free-text note directly into memory (no LLM round-trip).

  `share` (default false) decides who can read and cite it. False keeps the note private to
  the signed-in teacher (its own `notes:<user>` source); true teaches the commons, where
  every user of the workspace can retrieve and cite it. In open mode there is no signed-in
  user to own a note, so everything stays commons regardless.
}
